## SQ-PA-01 | [paintings] N of N modded variants built, no WARN, no Couldn't load painting
@group A
@commands Boot; grep `srv/logs/latest.log` for `\[paintings\]` and `Couldn't load painting`
@pass one line `[paintings] 445 of 445 modded painting variants built from <n> sources`, no `[paintings]` WARN, no `Couldn't load painting`
@fails `paintings/PaintingPack` (registry or mod file lookup); WARN lines name the variant; old jar still in `mods/` (no line at all)
@from batches/r1113/c3_a1.qb
bootexpect \[paintings\] (\d+) of \1 modded painting variants built from \d+ sources
bootreject WARN.*\[paintings\]
bootreject Couldn't load painting
shell grep -h "\[paintings\]" logs/latest.log | cut -c1-250 | head -5
look count was 445 when the row was written; another number is fine if it is N of N

## SQ-PA-02 | 60 vanilla painting files in the scratch kubejs; no second built line and no painting error after /reload
@group A
@commands `ls srv/kubejs/data/creativeengineering/paintings/minecraft \| wc -l`; `/reload`, then grep the log again
@pass 60 files; after `/reload` no second `[paintings] ... built` line (cached) and no painting error
@fails prep_srv.sh copy of `kubejs/data`; cache in `PaintingPack.files()`
@from batches/r1113/c3_a1.qb
shell ls kubejs/data/creativecompat/paintings/minecraft | wc -l
shell test "$(ls kubejs/data/creativecompat/paintings/minecraft | wc -l)" = 60
> reload
waitlog Reloading!|reload 60
sleep 20
reject \[paintings\] .*modded painting variants built
reject Couldn't load painting
look path moved: kubejs/data/creativecompat/paintings/minecraft (row said creativeengineering); no `[paintings] ... built` line in this row's segment (cached)

## SQ-PA-03 | extraSources: art for toomanypaintings:afternoon from pa_test.zip; WARN for no_such.zip; still N of N built
@group A
@commands Stop; `python3 tools/scratch_query/painting_test_zip.py OUT/srv/pa_test.zip`; `qrun.py toml` set `[paintings] extraSources = ["pa_test.zip", "no_such.zip"]` in `srv/config/creativecompat-common.toml`; boot
@pass `[paintings] art for toomanypaintings:afternoon from pa_test.zip (over toomanypaintings-...jar)`; WARN `extraSources no_such.zip: no such file or folder`; still 445 built
@fails `PaintingPack.extraSources` path resolution (game folder = `srv/`)
@from batches/r1113/c3_a2.qb
shell grep -n "extraSources" config/creativecompat-common.toml; ls -l pa_test.zip
bootexpect \[paintings\] art for toomanypaintings:afternoon from pa_test\.zip \(over toomanypaintings
bootexpect \[paintings\] extraSources no_such\.zip: no such file or folder
bootexpect \[paintings\] (\d+) of \1 modded painting variants built
look WARN text is "extraSources no_such.zip: no such file or folder (<path>)" in the current jar (row text without the path)

## SQ-PA-04 | [paintings] enabled = false: no built line, boots clean
@group A
@commands Stop; set `[paintings] enabled = false`; boot
@pass no `[paintings] ... built` line; boots clean
@fails `CompatConfig.Paintings.enabled`
@from batches/r1113/c3_a3.qb passed
bootreject \[paintings\] .*modded painting variants built
bootexpect Done \(
shell grep -n -A3 "^\[paintings\]" config/creativecompat-common.toml | head -4

